{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a gargantuan alien spaceship invades and unleashes countless combat weapons upon Earth, demolishing human civilization in the blink of an eye. Although humans succeeded in developing special weapons that could deal an effective blow to the aliens, it was too late to revive their civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To this day, however, the Earth has yet to fall silent despite its abandoned cities, for swarm weapons known as &quot;CogrinaUnits,&quot; 12-meter-tall autonomous humanoid units, collect and operate the limited number of special weapons that remain, and continue to fight against the aliens, all for the sake of accomplishing the mission humanity entrusted them with....</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Simple yet varied missions with a wide range of fighting styles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbChoose whether to take down the multi-legged robot weapons ravaging the city by leveraging the terrain, or to move in close and finish them off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe next unit is sent out immediately once you are defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbOnly a limited amount of equipment remains, so you'll need to recover items from defeated units to continue the battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0A story of hope told between battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFind out what comes of the battle against the overwhelming enemy forces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbLight-hearted conversation scenes with fellow units during intermissions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPlus a shiba inu!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551190?t=1762352727","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551190?t=1762352727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551190/665af093b17d1d01fcc722cdf9474b820c5f7543/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762352727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551190/665af093b17d1d01fcc722cdf9474b820c5f7543/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762352727","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a gargantuan alien spaceship invades and unleashes countless combat weapons upon Earth, demolishing human civilization in the blink of an eye. Although humans succeeded in developing special weapons that could deal an effective blow to the aliens, it was too late to revive their civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To this day, however, the Earth has yet to fall silent despite its abandoned cities, for swarm weapons known as &quot;CogrinaUnits,&quot; 12-meter-tall autonomous humanoid units, collect and operate the limited number of special weapons that remain, and continue to fight against the aliens, all for the sake of accomplishing the mission humanity entrusted them with....</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Simple yet varied missions with a wide range of fighting styles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbChoose whether to take down the multi-legged robot weapons ravaging the city by leveraging the terrain, or to move in close and finish them off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe next unit is sent out immediately once you are defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbOnly a limited amount of equipment remains, so you'll need to recover items from defeated units to continue the battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0A story of hope told between battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFind out what comes of the battle against the overwhelming enemy forces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbLight-hearted conversation scenes with fellow units during intermissions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPlus a shiba inu!</p>","developers":["Sunfish Kumano"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551190/f4ddf7e364bc11a24420fe01748b642d22ede085/header.jpg?t=1762352727","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Sunfish Kumano.<br />\r\nPublished by Waku Waku Games.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3551190/7884788/0718e20797b4ce0c1f6af61fe5f7d1b6670f8b09/1761914611/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762352725","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3551190/7884788/0718e20797b4ce0c1f6af61fe5f7d1b6670f8b09/1761914611/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762352725","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3551190/7884788/0718e20797b4ce0c1f6af61fe5f7d1b6670f8b09/1761914611/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762352725","id":257225101,"name":"The Last Salvage SQUAD trailer2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257225101/737903f11202dc6c03a06956c991da5c4bc08c10/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762352725"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3551190/872670/c20bbf259097d3f01f1bea1ded5325c6b8244a89/1750859913/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744973755","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3551190/872670/c20bbf259097d3f01f1bea1ded5325c6b8244a89/1750859913/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744973755","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3551190/872670/c20bbf259097d3f01f1bea1ded5325c6b8244a89/1750859913/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744973755","id":257127551,"name":"The Last Salvage SQUAD trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127551/38b35a117960fa2a9b01de95f4b717f91ab20393/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744973755"}],"name":"The Last Salvage Squad","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"mi